    <hr style="width:50%; border:1px solid red;">
    <h3>PARDON FEE: 1,000,000 D9BUX</h3>
    <p>CURRENT BALANCE: <span id="ban-balance">0</span> D9BUX</p>
    <button onclick="attemptPardon()" style="background:red; color:white; padding:10px 20px; border:none; cursor:pointer; font-weight:bold;">PAY PARDON FEE</button>
